      "category": "COMBINED",
      "subsection": "Arenas",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Players entering an Arena event from their base would appear in empty space upon leaving the event. This has been fixed."
    },
    {
      "category": "COMBINED",
      "subsection": "Flashback",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Critters in Flashback missions will once again spawn at the correct level."
    },
    {
      "category": "COMBINED",
      "subsection": "Global Chat",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Using the right-click menu to remove a global friend works again."
    },
    {
      "category": "COMBINED",
      "subsection": "Tasks",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed a bug that was causing many hostage mission maps to crash, making it impossible to enter those maps and complete those missions."
